  ═══ WHAT record GENERATES ═══

  record Trade(String tradeId, BigDecimal amount) {}

  Compiler generates:
    private final String tradeId;           ← immutable field
    private final BigDecimal amount;        ← immutable field
    Trade(String tradeId, BigDecimal amount) ← canonical constructor
    String tradeId()                         ← accessor (not getTradeId!)
    BigDecimal amount()                      ← accessor
    boolean equals(Object o)                 ← based on ALL components
    int hashCode()                           ← based on ALL components
    String toString()                        ← "Trade[tradeId=..., amount=...]"

